New booking: <%= @booking&.class_session&.class_template&.title || 'your class' %>

Hi <%= @booking&.class_session&.instructor&.name.presence || 'there' %>,

A new booking has been made for one of your classes.

Client: <%= @booking&.client&.name.presence || @booking&.client&.email %>
<% if (start_time = @booking&.class_session&.start_time) %>
When: <%= start_time.strftime('%B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p') %>
<% end %>
<% if (duration = @booking&.class_session&.class_template&.duration_minutes) %>
Duration: <%= duration %> minutes
<% end %>
<% if (location_name = @booking&.class_session&.class_template&.studio_location&.name) %>
Location: <%= location_name %>
<% end %>
<% if (room = @booking&.class_session&.room).present? %>
Room: <%= room %>
<% end %>

View booking details: <%= @booking_url %>

